OL,5,G0600 Teleshopping                      
OL,6,     FShopping from Home.               
OL,7,G0900 Find It, Fix It, Flog It          
OL,8,     FSimon O'Brien and Henry Cole head 
OL,9,     Fto Middlesex and Surrey, where    
OL,10,     Fprojects include repurposing a    
OL,11,     F1950s hairdryer, updating a school
OL,12,     Fdesk and the restoration of a     
OL,13,     Fchild's motorbike.                
OL,14,G1000 Find It, Fix It, Flog It          
OL,15,     FOn the south coast, Henry Cole    
OL,16,     Fgets to work an aircraft fuel     
OL,17,     Ftank, while Simon O'Brien becomes 
OL,18,     Fobsessed with a 1960s speedboat.  
